  (text "AUTHORITATIVE for connectivity. The ASCII drawing in pitch-stage.md is a REPRESENTATION of this file.\n\n[V_ref] TRIM-OFFSET spans VREFOUT to AGND_MOD; its wiper injects through R-VREF-INJ against R-VREF-SER into the\nfollower, which runs at gain 1.02 (R-VREF-FB / R-VREF-GND): 2.500 V at mid-travel.\n\n[gain] TRIM-GAIN (0-200R, CW end strapped to the wiper) in the R2 leg against R-GAIN-CTR (100R) in the R1 leg:\nratio 1 at mid-travel, +/-1 percent.\n\n[RN-PITCH] The exposed pad (EP) and both ends of the two spare sections go to AGND_MOD." (at 40.64 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 2891894c-603d-5ae8-8b00-f0ccec08ea7f))
  (text "THIS CIRCUIT IS ON BOTH MODULE BOARDS (ADR 0023). Page main holds its main-board parts, page jack the parts behind the panel; the labels here join the two pages, and on the boards J-B2B-MOD joins them. Each board places its own page." (at 60.96 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9bd0b77f-5063-5d73-90d0-f9f85985b3df))
